.TH LIBMPQ__FILE_STREAM_TELL 3 2026-09-24 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__file_stream_tell \- return a logical file-stream position.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.BI "int32_t libmpq__file_stream_tell(mpq_file_stream_s *" stream ", libmpq__off_t *" position ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Store the current logical position in \fI*position\fP. This operation performs
no archive I/O.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns \fBLIBMPQ_SUCCESS\fP on success.
.SH ERRORS
\fBLIBMPQ_ERROR_EXIST\fP reports an invalid stream or output pointer.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__file_stream_seek (3)
